 docs/guide/agent-model-matching.md   | 2 +-
 docs/guide/installation.md           | 2 +-
 docs/guide/overview.md               | 2 +-
 docs/reference/configuration.md      | 4 ++--
 7 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

